# Build directories
debian/
rpm/
AppDir/

# Merge note: upstream ignored `/tools/` here (downloaded build tools). The
# Agents tree ships a real, tracked `tools/` directory (agents-browser-bridge,
# agents-extension-mcp, chat_ui_manifest.txt), so the line is gone. Ignore the
# downloaded tool by name if it ever comes back.

